@startuml UC17_SelectStarter_UseCase
skinparam linetype ortho
left to right direction

actor Player

rectangle "Starter Pokemon System" {
  (Start new game)
  (Meet Professor)
  (Receive starter options)
  (Display starter choices)
  (Player selects starter)
  (Confirm selection)
  (Receive Pokemon)
  (Add to Pokedex)
  (Add to team)
  (Get Pokedex)
  (Get Pokeballs)
  (Game starts)
}

Player --> (Start new game)
(Start new game) --> (Meet Professor)
(Meet Professor) --> (Receive starter options)

(Receive starter options) --> (Display starter choices)
note right of (Display starter choices)
  Typically 3 starter options:
  - Grass type
  - Fire type
  - Water type
end note

(Display starter choices) --> (Player selects starter)
Player --> (Player selects starter)
(Player selects starter) --> (Confirm selection)
(Confirm selection) --> (Receive Pokemon)

(Receive Pokemon) --> (Add to team)
(Add to team) --> (Get Pokeballs)
(Get Pokeballs) --> (Game starts)
(Game starts) --> Player

@enduml
